{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XpHTd98vpVuvXQ43PuPtCP","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Code CLI reference official documentation\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CLI reference - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference\"},{\"title\":\"Claude\",\"url\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference.md\"},{\"title\":\"claude-code/CHANGELOG.md at main · anthropics/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/release-notes/claude-code\"},{\"title\":\"Agent SDK overview - Claude Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/api/agent-sdk/overview?_hsenc=p2ANqtz-_k4q-Yl0Xna4yeebcx02VcnM52GRlLWi_s0_ruSnM7QDFEMcki0s9o9OJP_4Z0a9FJ5oS7\"},{\"title\":\"CLI reference - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference\"},{\"title\":\"Overview - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview\"},{\"title\":\"Overview - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview\"},{\"title\":\"Quickstart - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/quickstart\"},{\"title\":\"Quickstart - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/quickstart\"},{\"title\":\"Plugins reference - Claude Code Docs\",\"url\":\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/plugins-reference\"}]\n\nI found the official Claude Code CLI reference documentation. Here are the key resources:\n\n## Official Documentation\n\nThe Claude Code CLI reference is a complete reference for the command-line interface, including commands and flags.\n\nThe official documentation is available at:\n- **docs.claude.com**: https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference\n- **docs.anthropic.com**: https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference\n\n## Key Features Documented\n\nClaude Code provides four flags for customizing the system prompt, all of which work in both interactive and non-interactive modes, with --system-prompt and --system-prompt-file being mutually exclusive and the append flags combinable with either replacement flag.\n\nIf you mistype a subcommand, Claude Code suggests the closest match and exits without starting a session, for example, typing \"claude udpate\" prints \"Did you mean claude update?\"\n\n## Related Documentation\n\nAdditional resources include documentation on interactive mode, slash commands, quickstart guide, common workflows, settings, and SDK documentation.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[REDACTED]","uuid":"[REDACTED]","timestamp":"2026-08-27T12:59:05.875Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Claude Code CLI reference official documentation","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01BWenUwLALuVkZcbRAXYBUN","content":[{"title":"CLI reference - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference"},{"title":"Claude","url":"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference.md"},{"title":"claude-code/CHANGELOG.md at main · anthropics/claude-code","url":"https://docs.claude.com/en/release-notes/claude-code"},{"title":"Agent SDK overview - Claude Docs","url":"https://docs.claude.com/en/api/agent-sdk/overview?_hsenc=p2ANqtz-_k4q-Yl0Xna4yeebcx02VcnM52GRlLWi_s0_ruSnM7QDFEMcki0s9o9OJP_4Z0a9FJ5oS7"},{"title":"CLI reference - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference"},{"title":"Overview - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview"},{"title":"Overview - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview"},{"title":"Quickstart - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/quickstart"},{"title":"Quickstart - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/quickstart"},{"title":"Plugins reference - Claude Code Docs","url":"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/plugins-reference"}]},"I found the official Claude Code CLI reference documentation. Here are the key resources:\n\n## Official Documentation\n\nThe Claude Code CLI reference is a complete reference for the command-line interface, including commands and flags.\n\nThe official documentation is available at:\n- **docs.claude.com**: https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference\n- **docs.anthropic.com**: https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/cli-reference\n\n## Key Features Documented\n\nClaude Code provides four flags for customizing the system prompt, all of which work in both interactive and non-interactive modes, with --system-prompt and --system-prompt-file being mutually exclusive and the append flags combinable with either replacement flag.\n\nIf you mistype a subcommand, Claude Code suggests the closest match and exits without starting a session, for example, typing \"claude udpate\" prints \"Did you mean claude update?\"\n\n## Related Documentation\n\nAdditional resources include documentation on interactive mode, slash commands, quickstart guide, common workflows, settings, and SDK documentation."],"durationSeconds":5.908199208,"searchCount":1}}
